# === Except: results a margaret run pushes back (predictions + stats + the run log) are small
# (label arrays / text, not training data) and are meant to be tracked -- re-include them despite
# the blanket *.npy/*.pkl/*.log excludes above ===
!/nas-challenge-submission-main/results/
!/nas-challenge-submission-main/results/**